NOTE ON BUNDLED FIRMWARE

The binary images under bin/ are extracted from a retail device and contain
components owned by their respective upstream projects, including but not
limited to:

  * ARM Trusted Firmware (BSD-3-Clause)
  * U-Boot (GPL-2.0-or-later)
  * Airoha / EcoNet vendor boot chain and X.509 certificates

They are included solely for device repair and interoperability purposes.
Redistribution and use are subject to the terms of those upstream licenses.
The MIT license above applies only to the tools, scripts and documentation
authored in this repository.
